{
 "id": "seg5a",
 "title": "授权风险",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 110.76,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5a-00",
   "text": "最后一类风险，是授权。",
   "spoken": "最后一类风险，是授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 1.697,
   "speechEnd": 3.7
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-01",
   "text": "approve 允许另一个地址，代你转出代币。",
   "spoken": "approve 允许另一个地址，代你转出代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-01.wav",
   "start": 4.14,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 4.241,
   "speechEnd": 7.521
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-02",
   "text": "最后一道题。Alice 授权了 Bob 100 枚，现在想改成 50 枚。",
   "spoken": "最后一道题。Alice 授权了 Bob 100 枚，现在想改成 50 枚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-02.wav",
   "start": 7.96,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 7.96,
   "speechEnd": 12.52
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-03",
   "text": "Bob 能抢先打包自己的交易。他最多能拿走多少？",
   "spoken": "Bob 能抢先打包自己的交易。他最多能拿走多少？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-03.wav",
   "start": 12.98,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 13.08,
   "speechEnd": 17.674
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-04",
   "text": "150 枚。他先花掉旧的 100 枚。",
   "spoken": "150 枚。他先花掉旧的 100 枚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-04.wav",
   "start": 18.36,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 18.36,
   "speechEnd": 21.943
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-05",
   "text": "等新额度生效，再花 50 枚。",
   "spoken": "等新额度生效，再花 50 枚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-05.wav",
   "start": 22.34,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 22.432,
   "speechEnd": 24.729
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-06",
   "text": "这叫 approve 竞态。",
   "spoken": "这叫 approve 竞态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-06.wav",
   "start": 25.2,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "speechStart": 25.2,
   "speechEnd": 26.94
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-07",
   "text": "缓解办法之一：先设成 0，看旧额度有没有被花掉，再设新值。",
   "spoken": "缓解办法之一：先设成 0，看旧额度有没有被花掉，再设新值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-07.wav",
   "start": 27.34,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 27.34,
   "speechEnd": 32.513
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-08",
   "text": "之二：用 safeDecreaseAllowance 相对减少。额度已被抢先花掉，交易就回滚。",
   "spoken": "之二：用 safeDecreaseAllowance 相对减少。额度已被抢先花掉，交易就回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-08.wav",
   "start": 32.92,
   "dur": 7.92,
   "speechStart": 33.014,
   "speechEnd": 40.638
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-09",
   "text": "forceApprove 只解决兼容问题，不解决竞态。",
   "spoken": "forceApprove 只解决兼容问题，不解决竞态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-09.wav",
   "start": 41.06,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 41.06,
   "speechEnd": 45.212
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-10",
   "text": "比竞态更大的风险，是无限授权。",
   "spoken": "比竞态更大的风险，是无限授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-10.wav",
   "start": 45.6,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 45.6,
   "speechEnd": 48.494
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-11",
   "text": "协议一旦被攻破，攻击者能转走你钱包里全部的这种代币。",
   "spoken": "协议一旦被攻破，攻击者能转走你钱包里全部的这种代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-11.wav",
   "start": 48.94,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 49.03,
   "speechEnd": 54.057
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-12",
   "text": "即使你从没把它存进协议。",
   "spoken": "即使你从没把它存进协议。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-12.wav",
   "start": 54.52,
   "dur": 2.24,
   "speechStart": 54.52,
   "speechEnd": 56.531
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-13",
   "text": "钓鱼网站也盯着授权，诱导你签 approve，或者链下签名的 permit。",
   "spoken": "钓鱼网站也盯着授权，诱导你签 approve，或者链下签名的 permit。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-13.wav",
   "start": 56.98,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 57.074,
   "speechEnd": 62.431
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-14",
   "text": "最危险的组合，是任意调用加授权。",
   "spoken": "最危险的组合，是任意掉用加授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-14.wav",
   "start": 62.88,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 62.88,
   "speechEnd": 65.991
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-15",
   "text": "路由合约持有用户的授权，",
   "spoken": "路由合约持有用户的授权，",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-15.wav",
   "start": 66.38,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 66.476,
   "speechEnd": 68.565
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-16",
   "text": "又允许用户指定任意目标，和任意 calldata。",
   "spoken": "又允许用户指定任意目标，和任意 calldata。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-16.wav",
   "start": 69.0,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 69.092,
   "speechEnd": 72.757
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-17",
   "text": "攻击者就能让它，调用代币的 transferFrom，从受害者转给自己。",
   "spoken": "攻击者就能让它，掉用代币的 transferFrom，从受害者转给自己。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-17.wav",
   "start": 73.22,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 73.22,
   "speechEnd": 78.526
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-18",
   "text": "2023 年 4 月，Sushi 的 RouteProcessor2。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 4 月，Sushi 的 RouteProcessor2。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-18.wav",
   "start": 78.96,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 79.067,
   "speechEnd": 82.258
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-19",
   "text": "路由里的池子地址，由用户填写。",
   "spoken": "路由里的池子地址，由用户填写。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-19.wav",
   "start": 82.7,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 82.796,
   "speechEnd": 85.476
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-20",
   "text": "攻击者填入自己的池子，在回调里，把任意授权过的用户设成付款人。",
   "spoken": "攻击者填入自己的池子，在回掉里，把任意授权过的用户设成付款人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-20.wav",
   "start": 85.88,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 85.88,
   "speechEnd": 91.459
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-21",
   "text": "回调校验只问：是不是刚才调用的地址？",
   "spoken": "回掉较验只问：是不是刚才掉用的地址？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-21.wav",
   "start": 91.86,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 91.965,
   "speechEnd": 95.441
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-22",
   "text": "没有问：它是不是真实的池子？",
   "spoken": "没有问：它是不是真实的池子？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-22.wav",
   "start": 96.12,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 96.22,
   "speechEnd": 98.231
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-23",
   "text": "按公开分析，约 330 万美元被盗。",
   "spoken": "按公开分析，约 330 万美元被盗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-23.wav",
   "start": 98.94,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 99.037,
   "speechEnd": 102.533
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-24",
   "text": "规则是：持有授权的合约，必须禁止任意调用目标和任意 calldata。",
   "spoken": "规则是：持有授权的合约，必须禁止任意掉用目标和任意 calldata。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-24.wav",
   "start": 103.0,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 103.093,
   "speechEnd": 109.34
  }
 ],
